WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.520
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:11.360
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:15.780
Ako-chan and Kirara-chan participated in the Kira Kira Unit Cup.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:19.370
Thanks to how in sync their 
performance was, they took home the gold. {or N'sync -a}

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:23.410
Kirara-chan got a huge boost to her Aikatsu Ranking.

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:27.290
It marked the beginning of the all-out sprint to the Final Tournament.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:33.720
In order to prove I'm the brightest first star in the world, my Aikatsu will have to pass the coming tests.{hyphens for adjectival phrases, not when they're not}

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:40.680
There sure are a lot of grand shows and auditions.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:48.690
Yeah. We'll have to choose our events carefully to navigate our way up the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.730
Self-producing, huh.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:52.440
What'll you do, Rola?

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:53.950
I'm not sure...

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:55.150
How about this one?

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:56.160
That looks good!

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.620
It gives a lot of points too.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.070
"Everyone shine"...

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:59.950
Oh no, it's too late to apply!

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.370
So there are auditions like this too.

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:40.390
This is bad... this is very bad.

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:46.520
Is it really that bad, your vegetable juice?

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:51.900
Yeah... I mean, no. I was referring to the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:56.280
As you can see, Venus Ark has the top spots on lockdown.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:04.370
If we fail to act, all of our students dreaming of becoming idols will be lured to Venus Ark.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:07.250
For the future of Four Star Academy...

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.210
Stomach medicine?

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:15.960
We must have our own idols step up as well.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:20.760
Get the student council and admins together to provide support.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:22.840
Roger!

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:24.930
All right,

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.680
here's why I called this meeting.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:34.940
The only idols from Four Star in the Aikatsu Ranking are Yume-chan, Rola-chan, and Mahiru-chan.{wideness}

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:39.570
Plus there's also Alice-chan who 
transferred here from Venus Ark. {I think the dess was recorded wrong or something}

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:41.400
As you can see,

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:46.280
only the top four idols advance to the Final Tournament.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:51.410
It will be an intense battle for the top four up until the finish in February.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:54.080
It'll be a battle without honor or humanity! {this is an exact title of a movie}{I'll believe you in}

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.290
This sort of thing gets me jazzed!

00:03:56.290 --> 00:04:00.800
There's quite a big difference in the points you can get from each event.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:06.050
The end of the year is especially packed with high-point events.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:12.020
As Shakespeare said, "Self-conceit may lead to self-destruction". {except, it wasn't him who said that. either that or google is wrong about the english for this japanese}

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:20.190
Do not be distracted by the choices before you. 
Instead, stop and think carefully about which events to enter.

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:21.320
Okay!

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.570
Yes!

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:27.490
Actually, I already have an audition in mind that I really want to try for.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:32.710
"Everyone Shine! Dream Idol Audition"?

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:37.000
Yes, it looks like a big audition with no entry requirements.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:41.880
Whoever wins will have their performance broadcast worldwide.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:48.050
But Nijino-san, I'm sure you have plenty of offers for shows that give far more points.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:51.310
Still, I want to do this audition.

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:54.480
Well then, going for it is for the best!

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.400
Right! I'll give it my best!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:05.570
It's been a while since my last audition. I'm even feeling kind of nervous.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:09.950
It seems like the self-promotion segment has the most weight in this audition.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:13.830
In the past, participants have shown off their best songs or dances.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.500
Songs?

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:20.590
That's it! I'm actually right in the middle of writing a new song.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:24.010
What do you think about singing it for the judges?

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:29.050
Sounds great! You love singing, so that'll be perfect for your promotion.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.390
I agree. Let's go with that.

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:35.640
Now that I've got my direction, 
it's time to dive into the composition!

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.270
I'll be in the lesson room.

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:42.280
Yume is so bright.

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:44.440
We have to work hard too.

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:51.240
I've decided to apply for the same audition as Yume-chan.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.830
Baa! But why?!

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:58.580
There's no reason to choose an audition you already know has a tough rival!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:02.250
I want to do Aikatsu together with Yume-chan.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.300
How intriguing.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:11.930
Aria has the skills to face her. 
Nobody can tell where the chips will fall.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:14.720
Got it! I'll cheer for you!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:15.980
Thank you!

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:22.610
Writing lyrics is hard...

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:27.110
I just can't find the right word to finish this.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:31.280
I really want the lyrics to represent who I am...

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.040
Shh, be quiet!

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.250
We can't interrupt her!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.340
What's going on?

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.720
B-Bonjour, Yume-san!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:54.640
I-It's just, um... we just wanted to see how a senpai in S4 trained!

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.970
We were trying to secretly peek in.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.810
We're sorry!

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:03.060
That's all? If you want, you're welcome to come in anytime!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.860
Do you want to Aikatsu together?

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.570
With pleasure!

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.490
Aikatsu!

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:12.620
Aikatsu!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:13.660
Aikatsu!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:17.160
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:24.000
Aikatsu. Aikatsu.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.340
Wow!

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:27.000
Amazing! {I actually typed this first: As expected!}

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.720
Yes, that's it! You're doing great!

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:37.350
Let's take a quick break.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:38.430
Okay.

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:51.070
Is that what I think it is?

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:55.950
Yep, it's my new song. I'm not finished yet, though.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:02.580
I'm trying as hard as I can to get it ready to sing for my upcoming audition.

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.790
You're participating in an audition?

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.670
I want to try out too!

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:08.920
Me too!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:13.470
We may never have another chance to take an audition with Yume-san!

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:19.100
Just doing Aikatsu alongside you is incredibly educational. {something something you set a good example}

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:21.310
It's like you illuminate us.

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:24.230
It feels like we start shining too!

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:29.570
<i>True, there's so much you can learn by doing Aikatsu with someone else.</i>

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.070
Let's share in the radiance

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:40.910
Yeah, this fits!

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:45.330
I think I'll be able to make this a splendid song thanks to you girls!

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.960
Let's work hard for the audition.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.010
Yes!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:03.980
Before you stand the entrants who have progressed to the final evaluation.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:10.730
The evaluation will be provided by the public in this hall.

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:16.910
Everyone here will be voting alongside the judges to decide which idol shines the brightest.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:20.740
Good luck, Yume-chan!

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:26.920
With that said, it's time to start the 
Everyone Shine! Dream Idol Audition!

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:47.020
Yume-san, I'm so glad to have the opportunity to be in this final evaluation with you.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:48.690
Yeah, me too.

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:55.950
I'm nervous about standing on stage after such a long gap.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:58.320
Alice-chan, are you okay?

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:01.450
Th-This is my first show in Japan... {well no wonder her ratings were dropping on Venus Ark once they got here}

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:10.500
<i>If everyone's this nervous, they won't be able to smile naturally.</i>

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.670
Aria-chan, let's do the thing! {or "the thing"}{or}

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:14.460
Huh?

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:19.260
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:20.720
Aikatsu!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:23.850
Everyone join in!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.970
So...

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.850
L-Like this?

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.980
Is this right?

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.810
This is Aikatsu too!

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:33.400
Everyone's doing it!

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.240
I'm getting dizzy!

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:39.740
That was fun!

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:40.740
Yeah!

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.910
Everyone's brightened up!

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.120
Did that help you relax at all?

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.500
Yes!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:50.000
Would the next entrant please step up?

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:50.960
Okay!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:58.130
Please introduce yourself.

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:01.760
I'm entry number 10, Nijino Yume.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:08.100
It was the phrase "everyone shine" that caught my eye and inspired me to apply for this audition.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:16.440
It also matches my brand, Rainbow Berry Parfait, which is built around the concept of bringing people together to sparkle.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:23.780
What's wrong, Alice-chan?

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:28.080
I wasn't able to speak smoothly during my self-introduction.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:33.630
And after you went through the trouble of helping me relax...

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:40.550
If you keep making that face, 
you'll let this chance slip away.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.180
But...

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:47.260
I heard that the self-promotion we're doing after this has the most weight.

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:49.310
It's not over yet!

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.730
Okay!

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:55.150
We're doing the next round now.

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:57.150
Please follow me.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:10.620
For this audition, the self-promotion segment will be a little different from usual.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:16.040
Please self-produce your own coord using the dresses provided here.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:20.510
We would like you to demonstrate how brightly you can shine while under restrictions.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:23.880
Each person will have two minutes on stage.

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:30.520
After a ten minute break, we will begin the judging.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:31.430
Okay!

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:35.060
What now?

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:40.900
Look here, Yume-chan, it's cute! It's very cute!

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:44.200
You're right. I can already come up with so many different coords.

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:48.370
<i>I need to come up with a plan for my promotion in the next ten minutes.</i>

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:52.330
<i>With only two minutes, I won't be able to sing my entire song.</i>

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:58.130
<i>I'll cut it down to just the chorus, and for my dress and makeup...</i>

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:02.970
What's wrong, everyone?

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:08.220
I wasn't expecting this kind of 
self-promotion, so I'm quite lost...

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:10.470
I already brought an outfit for this...

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:12.470
My preparations have gone to waste.

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:18.190
<i>I see... none of them are used to this sort of self-promotion. {that look of utter despair on the red girl}</i>

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:27.110
It'll be okay. We still have time.

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:30.280
I'll help you out, so let's get ready together.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:33.370
Y-Yes, please do!

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:36.000
Tell me your plan, Alice-chan.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:43.010
Okay. So, because I'm from France, I prepared a French doll coord.

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:45.010
In that case...

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:48.890
For instance, you can combine these dresses...

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.890
and sprinkle accessories on it. {check length, if not then "decorate it like this"}

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:54.020
I look just like a doll!

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:55.930
Now for your makeup.

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:59.100
Très bien!

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:00.730
What about me?

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.780
Please give me advice too!

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:06.150
Sure thing! I'll go through it with you all one at a time.

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.360
Thank you!

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:14.330
When you take the stage, walk boldly and step half a shoe-length longer.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:15.160
Okay!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.710
Exactly! Be confident, and don't forget to smile.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:19.540
Yes!

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:21.340
Make your finishing pose sharp!{wait, in this context isn't it more like "finishing pose"}{sure why not}

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:22.210
Got it!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:27.550
Wonderful... Yume-chan is wonderful!

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:30.430
I'll lend a hand too, Yume-chan.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:33.310
Here are flowers for everyone!

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:39.230
Thanks, Aria-chan.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.810
You're welcome!

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:49.070
<i>This is exactly what it means to share in the radiance.</i>

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.660
Oh, it's about time!

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.960
Please head to the stage as soon as you're ready.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:08.300
<i>There aren't any good outfits left!</i>

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.050
Will you make it?

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:12.800
What shall we do, Yume-chan?

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:16.970
<i>If I calm down and think, I should be able to find a way.</i>

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:32.200
Thank you very much.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:37.830
It's time for our last entrant. Please come on stage!

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:51.010
Please begin your self-promotion.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:57.680
Today, I was filled with power while watching how luminously the other girls glowed.

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:02.690
Thanks to them, my heart is positively radiant!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:07.400
That is why I chose to come out in my everyday clothes.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:12.110
So that you could see my pure brilliance as clearly as possible.

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:16.990
Please listen to my song full of gratitude.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.310
Girls, let's sing together!

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:18.260
<i>Thank you, everyone.</i>

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:26.230
Thank you very much!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:34.780
I will now announce the results.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:43.580
The winner is entry number 10, Nijino Yume-san!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.960
Congratulations!

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:49.630
Thanks, girls!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:55.220
To tell you the truth, we received a report from the host just earlier.

00:17:55.220 --> 00:18:01.850
It appears that Nijino-san spent the entire prep time for the self-promotion supporting the other entrants.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:08.940
We believe she is the embodiment of this audition's theme, "everyone shine".

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.980
Congratulations, Nijino-san.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.780
Thank you!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:17.490
Coming up is a special performance by the winner!

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.700
<i>The Rainbow Étoile Coord.</i>

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:30.080
<i>In this dress I made with Koharu-chan, 
I'll share in the radiance with everyone!</i>

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:33.250
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:57.440
Dresses can make everyone shine!

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:55.410
<b>Aikatsu                        Ranking</b>

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:55.410
<b>Aikatsu                        Ranking</b>

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:55.410
Whoa, look at Yume's rank!{or "look at Yume's rank"}{my finger slipped}

00:21:55.830 --> 00:22:00.170
She's within striking range of making the Final Tournament!

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:02.710
You did great too, Aria!

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:04.920
Thank you very much!

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:07.430
Listen, Koharu-chan.

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:12.810
Thanks to this audition, I feel like I learned something vital.

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:16.140
I know. It's to "shine with everyone", right?

00:22:16.140 --> 00:22:19.770
Exactly! Just like Rainbow Berry Parfait's concept.

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:23.400
That's the kind of Aikatsu I want to keep doing!

00:23:55.700 --> 00:24:01.620
When my own radiance and a wonderful dress 
come together, I can deliver a shine to everyone!

00:24:01.620 --> 00:24:05.960
Shine with everyone. That's Rainbow Berry Parfait's real concept.

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:09.340
Yeah! I want to keep on sending out my Aikatsu!

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:14.090
I've made a decision. It all comes down to this fest!

00:24:14.090 --> 00:24:17.310
Huh? Elza-san's entering the festival too?

00:24:17.310 --> 00:24:19.560
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.140
The Number of Tears. {I swear to god this is a song reference and I can't remember which}{if you mean non-Aikatsu song, I'm sure lots of songs are like so because just of number}

00:24:21.140 --> 00:24:23.520
Become the first-star idol!
